{"id":"b7238dcddd029b45","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-parikh-theorem.md","title":"Parikh Theorem","display":"thm-parikh-theorem — Parikh Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-parikh-theorem","aliases":["72-thm-parikh-theorem"],"display":"thm-parikh-theorem — Parikh Theorem","depends_on":["[[72-df-i-delta-0]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1.2.7.1; §1.4.3–1.4.4","source_printed_pages":"87, 111–112","source_pdf_pages":"99, 123–124","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"Source statement/applicability and free-cut proof sketch read; full free-cut elimination and all inference cases not reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"round2_verification_status":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-parikh-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-parikh-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-parikh-theorem — Parikh Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e5e75be5dd53241\" href=\"?note=0e5e75be5dd53241\" title=\"72-df-i-delta-0\">72-df-i-delta-0</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1.2.7.1; §1.4.3–1.4.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"87, 111–112"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"99, 123–124"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Source statement/applicability and free-cut proof sketch read; full free-cut elimination and all inference cases not reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\">\\(I\\Delta_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^0\">\\(\\Delta_0^0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e5e75be5dd53241\" href=\"?note=0e5e75be5dd53241\" title=\"72-df-i-delta-0\">72-df-i-delta-0</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 为固定经典一阶可证性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})\">\\(\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 为互异变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(\\vec x,y)\\in\\Delta_0^0\">\\(A(\\vec x,y)\\in\\Delta_0^0\\)</span> 且自由变量包含于所显示变量中。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm A}\">\\(\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm A}\\)</span> 是已核对的项与变量支持接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(\\vec x)\">\\(t(\\vec x)\\)</span> 是项代入记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(I\\Delta_0\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\;\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm A}(t)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\}\\land\nI\\Delta_0\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\leq t(\\vec x)\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(I\\Delta_0\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\;\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm A}(t)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\}\\land\nI\\Delta_0\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\leq t(\\vec x)\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II §1.2.7.1，印刷 p. 87（PDF p. 99）的 Parikh 定理适用于有界理论；书中立即说明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\">\\(I\\Delta_0\\)</span> 可用有界公式公理化。本原子保留其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\">\\(I\\Delta_0\\)</span> 特例。</li>\n<li>已比对陈述及适用条件，读到 §1.4.3–1.4.4 印刷 pp. 111–112（PDF pp. 123–124）的 free-cut 证明提纲；尚未逐推理步验证整个证明，不据此升级为证明已核验。</li>\n<li>外层箭头是元定理，括号内才是对象理论可证性。界项明确只含输入变量；原式的对象/元层箭头歧义已消除。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-i-delta-0","status":"resolved","id":"0e5e75be5dd53241","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-i-delta-0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-i-delta-0","status":"resolved","id":"0e5e75be5dd53241","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I\\Delta_0$、$\\Delta_0^0$、$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}$ 取 [[72-df-i-delta-0]]，$\\vdash$ 为固定经典一阶可证性。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"I\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"A(\\vec x,y)\\in\\Delta_0^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm A}","display":false},{"tex":"t(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(I\\Delta_0\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\;\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm A}(t)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\}\\land\nI\\Delta_0\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\leq t(\\vec x)\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"I\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"I\\Delta_0","display":false}],"bytes":2331,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-parikh-theorem|thm-parikh-theorem — Parikh Theorem]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-parikh-theorem — Parikh Theorem](72-thm-parikh-theorem.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-208","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-parikh-theorem|thm-parikh-theorem — Parikh Theorem]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-517","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-parikh-theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["0e5e75be5dd53241"]}